---
import Claim from './Claim.astro';
---
<figure class="fig cm">
  <p class="fig-title">15 scenarios, every call accounted for</p>
  <table>
    <caption class="sr-only">Analyzer results on 15 scenarios</caption>
    <thead>
      <tr><td></td><th scope="col">Flagged</th><th scope="col">Not flagged</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th scope="row">Has a failure</th>
        <td class="good"><Claim id="iia.tp" /><span>caught</span></td>
        <td class="bad"><Claim id="iia.fn" /><span>missed</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th scope="row">Correct code</th>
        <td class="bad"><Claim id="iia.fp" /><span>false alarms</span></td>
        <td class="good"><Claim id="iia.tn" /><span>left alone</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <figcaption>
    All five errors are in the five hard cases built to sit outside the analyzer's documented limits.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  table {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  th {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    text-align: left;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem 0.3rem 0;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }
  thead th {
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  thead td {
    border: 0;
  }
  tbody td {
    padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;
    min-width: 7.5rem;
    vertical-align: top;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--bg);
  }
  tbody tr + tr td {
    border-top: 0;
  }
  td.good {
    box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--mint);
  }
  td.bad {
    box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--rose);
    background: var(--no-bg);
  }
  td :global(.claim) {
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-right: 0.45rem;
  }
  td > span:not(:global(.claim)) {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 26rem) {
    tbody td {
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
    }
  }
</style>
